  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investment Facility for UK Specialist Expertise (iFUSE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To facilitate the mobilisation of specialist expertise from Other Government Departments (OGDs) to support DFID&apos;s objectives for improving investment climate in developing countries.  The project will do this by delivering high quality advice in a range of specialist investment climate reforms in response to partner government requests and by facilitating knowledge exchange activities.</narrative>
  </description>
